---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Music · Shunkai Xu" page="music">
<style is:inline slot="head">

.sec h2{margin-bottom:var(--s5)}
.sec > p{max-width:62ch;color:var(--ink-2);margin:calc(-1 * var(--s2)) 0 var(--s4)}
.spec > a .m{color:var(--blue)}
.spec > div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));column-gap:24px;padding:var(--s4) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);align-items:baseline}
.spec .d em{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted)}
/* Recordings: full performances, one player */
.recs > li{display:block;padding:0}
.recs button{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));column-gap:24px;align-items:center;width:100%;padding:var(--s4) 0;border:0;background:none;color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.recs .n{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.recs .n svg{width:11px;height:11px;flex:none;fill:currentColor;opacity:.0;transition:opacity .2s}
.recs button:hover .n svg,.recs button[aria-pressed="true"] .n svg{opacity:1}
.recs button[aria-pressed="true"] .n{color:var(--orange)}
.recs .m{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.recs .n{grid-column:1/2}.recs .pic{grid-column:2/4}.recs .t{grid-column:4/7}.recs .d{grid-column:7/11;font-style:italic}.recs .m{grid-column:11/13}
.recs .pic img,.recs .noimg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:96px;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;background:var(--surface)}
.recs .noimg b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:17px;line-height:1}
.recs .noimg i{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.2;opacity:.7}
.recs .noimg{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:2px;padding:9px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
.recs button:hover img{filter:brightness(1.06)}
.recbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:var(--s4);padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--sheet)}
.recbar .pp{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}
.recbar .pp svg{width:14px;height:14px;fill:currentColor}
.recbar .pp .pa{display:none}.recbar.playing .pp .pl{display:none}.recbar.playing .pp .pa{display:block}
.recbar .info{min-width:0;display:grid;gap:8px}
.recbar .ti{font-size:17px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.recbar .ti span{color:var(--muted)}
.recbar input{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:18px;margin:0;background:none;cursor:pointer}
.recbar input::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:3px;background:linear-gradient(var(--orange),var(--orange)) 0/var(--p,0%) 100% no-repeat,var(--rule)}
.recbar input::-moz-range-track{height:3px;background:var(--rule)}
.recbar input::-moz-range-progress{height:3px;background:var(--orange)}
.recbar input::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:13px;height:13px;margin-top:-5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);border:0}
.recbar input::-moz-range-thumb{width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);border:0}
.recbar .tm{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.sec > p.rec-note{margin:var(--s3) 0 0}
</style>

<main id="main" class="wrap page">
  <div class="head">
    <h1>Music</h1>
    <p>Cello is my main instrument, and I play piano too. I've played for more than five years: solo repertoire, chamber music in the summers, and a few international competitions along the way. I study with Aihao Zheng.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-rec">
    <h2 id="h-rec">Recordings</h2>
    <p>Four performances of mine, in full. The <a href="/#play">cello on the home page</a> plays a minute of each and moves with the sound.</p>
    <ol class="spec recs" id="recs"></ol>
    <div class="recbar" id="recbar">
      <button class="pp" type="button" aria-label="Play"><svg class="pl" viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 1.5v11l9.5-5.5z"/></svg><svg class="pa" viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 1.5h3.2v11H2.5zM8.3 1.5h3.2v11H8.3z"/></svg></button>
      <div class="info"><span class="ti" id="rec-title">Pick a recording</span><input type="range" id="rec-seek" min="0" max="1000" value="0" step="1" aria-label="Position in the recording"></div>
      <span class="tm mono" id="rec-time">0:00 / 0:00</span>
    </div>
    <p class="rec-note cap-text">Recorded by Shunkai Xu. Elgar and Tchaikovsky with piano; Dvořák from the Music@Menlo livestream, 26 July 2025.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-now">
    <h2 id="h-now">Working on</h2>
    <ul class="spec">
      <li><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Elgar</span><span class="d">Cello Concerto in E minor, Op. 85</span><span class="m">Concerto</span></li>
      <li><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Beethoven</span><span class="d">Cello Sonata No. 2 in G minor, Op. 5 No. 2</span><span class="m">Sonata</span></li>
      <li><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Paganini</span><span class="d">Variations on one string on a theme from Rossini's Moses, arr. Silva</span><span class="m">Showpiece</span></li>
      <li><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Arensky</span><span class="d">Piano Trio No. 1 in D minor, Op. 32. The next chamber piece I want to learn.</span><span class="m">Next</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-summer">
    <h2 id="h-summer">Summers</h2>
    <p>Linked rows go to the festival's own page.</p>
    <div class="spec">
      <a href="https://musicatmenlo.org/institute-alumni/"><span class="n">2025</span><span class="t">Music@Menlo</span><span class="d">Young Performers Program, Chamber Music Institute, California</span><span class="m">Alumni list</span></a>
      <a href="https://musicatmenlo.org/livestream/master-class-with-wu-han-piano-august-1-2025/"><span class="n">2025</span><span class="t">Master class with Wu Han</span><span class="d">Dvořák, Piano Trio No. 4 in E minor, "Dumky". <em>With Andrew Yin and Kalea Schunk.</em></span><span class="m">1 Aug</span></a>
      <div><span class="n">2026</span><span class="t">Juilliard</span><span class="d">Summer programme in New York. Classes, master classes and studio classes with Clara Kim, Sterling Elliott and Zvi Plesser, among others.</span><span class="m">Summer</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-play">
    <h2 id="h-play">Performances</h2>
    <div class="spec">
      <a href="https://musicatmenlo.org/livestream2025/koret-young-performers-concert-august-9-2025"><span class="n">2025</span><span class="t">Ravel</span><span class="d">String Quartet in F major, I. Koret Young Performers Concert, Music@Menlo</span><span class="m">9 Aug</span></a>
      <a href="https://musicatmenlo.org/livestream/koret-young-performers-concert-august-2-2025/"><span class="n">2025</span><span class="t">Dvořák</span><span class="d">Piano Trio in E minor, Op. 90 "Dumky", I and II. Koret Young Performers Concert, Music@Menlo</span><span class="m">2 Aug</span></a>
      <a href="https://musicatmenlo.org/livestream/koret-young-performers-concert-july-26-2025/"><span class="n">2025</span><span class="t">Dvořák</span><span class="d">Piano Quintet No. 2 in A major, Op. 81, IV. Koret Young Performers Concert, Music@Menlo</span><span class="m">26 Jul</span></a>
      <div><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">Popper</span><span class="d">Polonaise de concert, Op. 14. Église Sainte-Élisabeth-de-Hongrie, Paris</span><span class="m">11 May</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-comp">
    <h2 id="h-comp">Competitions</h2>
    <p>Mostly international competitions judged from video. Each row links to the published results.</p>
    <div class="spec">
      <a href="https://www.schubertcompetition.com/results24s4"><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">Schubert International Music Competition</span><span class="d">Platinum Prize, Youth (11 to 13), and the Best Schubert Performance award. Season 4, UK</span><span class="m">Results</span></a>
      <a href="https://claraschumanncompetition.com/prizeswinners/"><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">International Clara Schumann Competition</span><span class="d">Second Prize, Cello Junior A</span><span class="m">Results</span></a>
      <a href="https://avimc.org/2024-avimc-music-competition-winter-edition-winners/"><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">American Virtuoso International Music Competition</span><span class="d">First Prize, Music in the Romantic Period, Young Artist B. Winter edition</span><span class="m">Results</span></a>
      <a href="https://www.viennaclassicalmusic.org/2024-classical-music"><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">Vienna Classical Music Academy</span><span class="d">Prize winner, International Classical Music Competition</span><span class="m">Results</span></a>
      <a href="https://www.mahler.institute/en/category-32/"><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">Mahler Institute competition</span><span class="d">Prize winner, Category 3, with Saint-Saëns, Cello Concerto No. 1 in A minor, Op. 33</span><span class="m">Results</span></a>
      <a href="https://thebimcompetition.com/winners-2024/"><span class="n">2024</span><span class="t">Bellagrande International Music Competition</span><span class="d">Honorable mention</span><span class="m">Results</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<script>
import '../scripts/site.js';
import '../scripts/recordings.js';
</script>
</Layout>
